 "titulo": "The judge of the dead made him king of demons 👹 Zhong Kui Part 2 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "KING OF DEMONS",
 "descripcion": "In the Underworld, the judge of the dead saw the injustice done to Zhong Kui and gave him an army of ghosts. Centuries later, an emperor would need him.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you have forgiven the Emperor?\n\nFrom the Chinese legend of Zhong Kui, as recorded by Shen Kuo in Mengxi Bitan (11th century) and in later Ming-era versions.\n#zhongkui #chinesemythology #mythology #ancientchina #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "In the Underworld, a dead man arrived with his skull *cracked open*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The judge of the dead opened the Book of Life and Death.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "First in the imperial exam. Rejected for his face. Died on the palace steps.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The judge slammed the book shut. This was an *injustice*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So in the later legends, he gave Zhong Kui a new title.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Not scholar. Not minister. *King of Demons*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "His job: hunt every evil spirit that escapes into the human world.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because Zhong Kui didn't hunt alone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "An army of ghosts marched behind him, carrying his banners.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Demons who stole children. Spirits who brought fevers.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Ghosts who hid in houses and whispered at night.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Zhong Kui found them, fought them, and *ate them*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "His sword never rusted. His beard was full of thunder.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Centuries passed in the world of the living.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A new Emperor took the throne, Xuanzong of Tang.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And one winter, the Emperor fell sick with a fever no doctor could cure.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every night, he dreamed of a small demon in his palace.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stealing his treasures, and laughing. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
